---
import DocLayout from '../../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
---

<DocLayout
  title="Cluster 手册"
  description="Matter Cluster 定义速查手册"
  prev={{ title: '概念总览', href: '/concepts/' }}
>
  <h1>Cluster 手册</h1>
  <p>
    本手册收录常用 Matter Cluster 的定义，包括 Attribute、Command、枚举值等，
    方便开发过程中快速查阅。
  </p>

  <h2 id="cluster-list">已收录 Cluster</h2>

  <div class="cluster-grid">
    <a href="/clusters/door-lock/" class="cluster-card">
      <div class="cluster-id">0x0101</div>
      <div class="cluster-name">DoorLock</div>
      <div class="cluster-desc">门锁控制：锁定/解锁、PIN/RFID 凭证管理、操作记录</div>
    </a>

    <a href="/clusters/power-source/" class="cluster-card">
      <div class="cluster-id">0x002F</div>
      <div class="cluster-name">PowerSource</div>
      <div class="cluster-desc">电源信息：电池电量、充电状态、供电方式</div>
    </a>
  </div>

  <h2 id="contributing">如何新增</h2>
  <p>内容建设中...</p>
</DocLayout>

<style>
  .cluster-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .cluster-card {
    display: block;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }

  .cluster-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-active);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .cluster-id {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .cluster-name {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }

  .cluster-desc {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
